    "message": "[ipa-delivery:718] build(delivery): request the private common IPA 718 again after the native recipe fix (RPCS3 Core 914, MeloNX Core 717, menu bar without labels, Switch Pocket skin)\n\nSecond trigger of 718, recipe-only (fix 6ad78af6), on the same effective\nproduct tree (af020701, 7440 files, legal check passed; freeze 6ad78af6).\nThe first (run 42741950414, attempt 1) failed only in the native group:\npocket-skin-input-chain, \"No module named 'PIL'\", a duplicate of the command\nits flutter group already ran and passed with the pinned Pillow.\n- flutter: evidence reused from that run (job 129585277623, artifact\n  13729494334, 4aa7cf4a..., 42013 B; 19 commands passed; same tree,\n  commands and recipe reads).\n- native: 19 commands fresh (the PIL duplicate and the identical second run\n  of test/rpcs3_diagnostics546_native_test.py dropped); the simulator every\n  XCTest uses is booted once, before Flutter is set up.\n- RPCS3 Core 914 (pin f285a8a1) and MeloNX Core 717 (run 42728675479)\n  downloaded and authenticated, not recompiled; delivery contract fresh.\nRenderer selection unchanged (Vulkan/MoltenVK). No iPhone measurement; no\nFPS claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
